OL,3,GNEWSADrivers warned of three weeks of
OL,4,Aroadworks
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers in Bridgnorth face almost three
OL,7,Fweeks of disruption as resurfacing and
OL,8,Fwork to stablise a rock face get under
OL,9,Fway on some of the town's busiest
OL,10,Froads.
OL,12,FWork on Underhill Street, Hollybush
OL,13,FRoad, New Road and West Castle Street
OL,14,Fwould take place between 14 September
OL,15,Fand 2 October as part of a highways
OL,16,Fimprovement programme, Shropshire
OL,17,FCouncil said.
OL,19,FThe scheme will involve road closures,
OL,20,Ftemporary traffic lights and signed
OL,21,Fdiversion routes and be completed in
OL,22,Fthree phases.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
